    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>冬日歌曲推荐-冬日四重奏：从寒日问候到新年远航 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：🌰栗子、🐇Ava、🥬菜菜、🌲树 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlZ0QBLdXvl2C-q5LtbP5xmRQyoT.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;🗺️ 章节导览与时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span>1⃣️进入冬天 · 气息与晨光</span></p><span></span><p><span>用细腻的感官体验，描绘冬日降临的时刻。一起来进入冬天吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a> 菜菜🥬 첫 겨울이니까 (因为是初冬) - IU/成始境&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="601">10:01</a> 栗子🌰 입김 (HELLO) - 郑容和&amp;鲜于贞娥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> Ava🐇 Golden - HUNTR/X</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2064">34:24</a> 樹🌲 晴れやかな朝 (晴朗的早晨) - 小瀬村晶</span></p><span></span><p><span>2⃣️归家团圆 · 灯火与人烟</span></p><span></span><p><span>从自然景象转向人间烟火，聚焦团聚的温暖与热闹。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2348">39:08</a> 栗子🌰 声无哀乐-闲人夜游灯火会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2775">46:15</a> Ava🐇 Zoo - Disney/Shakira</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3238">53:58</a> 菜菜🥬 함께 (一起) - Noel</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3839">01:03:59</a> 樹🌲 Winter (Version for Harp &amp; String Trio) - Alis Huws</span></p><span></span><p><span>3⃣️探索与期望 · 漫游与新生</span></p><span></span><p><span>从当下的安宁出发，展开对自然、内心与未来的深远探索。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4719">01:18:39</a> 菜菜🥬 Winter Wonderland - Laufey</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5021">01:23:41</a> 栗子🌰 Oltremare - Ludovico Einaudi</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6285">01:44:45</a> 樹🌲 The Cycle Of Nature - 小瀬村晶</span></p>]]></description>
